    "roles": ["band_member", "session", "educator", "author", "bandleader"],
    "summary": "Porcupine Tree's drummer from In Absentia (2002), King Crimson's from 2008, The Pineapple Thief's from 2016, and the author of Rhythmic Illusions: a method of displacing and modulating a groove so the same part is heard differently. On record he makes odd meters sound even, the hat on the quarter over a kick and snare in cells of seven or five (he calls it 'overriding'), on a close, dry Sonor kit with a small, tight snare. He wants complex rhythm to sound musical, 'not just clever'."
  },
